---@alias gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.PickTimeSeriesFilterRankingMethodEnum "METHOD_UNSPECIFIED"|"METHOD_MEAN"|"METHOD_MAX"|"METHOD_MIN"|"METHOD_SUM"|"METHOD_LATEST"

