---@class gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.StatisticalTimeSeriesFilter
---@field rankingMethod? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.StatisticalTimeSeriesFilterRankingMethodEnum|string rankingMethod is applied to a set of time series, and then the produced value for each individual time series is used to compare a given time series to others. These are methods that cannot be applied stream-by-stream, but rather require the full context of a request to evaluate time series.
