---@field tableDisplayOptions? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.TableDisplayOptions Optional. Table display options for configuring how the table is rendered.
---@field tableTemplate? string Optional. A template string for naming TimeSeries in the resulting data set. This should be a string with interpolations of the form ${label_name}, which will resolve to the label's value i.e. "${resource.labels.project_id}."

