---@field aggregation? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.Aggregation By default, the raw time series data is returned. Use this field to combine multiple time series for different views of the data.
---@field filter? string Required. The monitoring filter (https://cloud.google.com/monitoring/api/v3/filters) that identifies the metric types, resources, and projects to query.
---@field secondaryAggregation? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.Aggregation Apply a second aggregation after aggregation is applied.

---A pair of time series filters that define a ratio computation. The output time series is the pair-wise division of each aligned element from the numerator and denominator time series.
