---@field numerator? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.RatioPart The numerator of the ratio.
---@field secondaryAggregation? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.Aggregation Apply a second aggregation after the ratio is computed.
---@field pickTimeSeriesFilter? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.PickTimeSeriesFilter Ranking based time series filter.
---@field statisticalTimeSeriesFilter? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.StatisticalTimeSeriesFilter Statistics based time series filter. Note: This field is deprecated and completely ignored by the API.

---TimeSeriesQuery collects the set of supported methods for querying time series data from the Stackdriver metrics API.
