---@field treemapHierarchy? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.StringList Required. Ordered labels representing the hierarchical treemap structure.
---@field dataSets? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.TreemapDataSetList Required. The collection of datasets used to construct and populate the treemap. For the rendered treemap rectangles: Color is determined by the aggregated value for each grouping. Size is proportional to the count of time series aggregated within that rectangle's segment.

---The data represented by the treemap. Needs to include the data itself, plus rules on how to organize it hierarchically.
---@class gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.TreemapDataSet
