---@field pieChart? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.PieChart A widget that displays timeseries data as a pie chart.
---@field treemap? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.Treemap A widget that displays data as a treemap.
---@field alertChart? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.AlertChart A chart of alert policy data.
---@field filterControl? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.FilterControl A widget that displays an input field to change the value of a template variable.
---@field xyChart? gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.XyChart A chart of time series data.

---@alias gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.WidgetList gcp.unstable.monitoring_v1.Widget[]

